# The compiled generator binary, if someone runs `go build ./cmd/gen-apidocs`
# from the repo root. Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored
# `gen-apidocs` also matches the DIRECTORY cmd/gen-apidocs/ and silently
# excludes the generator's source from every commit.
/gen-apidocs
